{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46100","headline":"酬王相公见赠 · 贯休","name":"酬王相公见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤拙将来岂偶然，不能爲漏滴青莲。\n一从麟笔题墙後，常祗冥心古像前。\n九德陶熔空有迹，六窗清净始通禅。\n今朝幸捧琼瑶赠，始见玄中更有玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}